</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 23, 2004 - 1:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->How would the guy know BTK&#39;s secret symbol? It hasn&#39;t been published and was included with her driver&#39;s license scan.  <BR> <BR>I&#39;ve had access to tons of BTK material &#40;more than was published in January&#41; and I still don&#39;t know what the symbol is.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
